WEBVTT

1
00:00:08.267 --> 00:00:16.277
Daisy: Is that really Miss Gray?

2
00:00:16.278 --> 00:00:20.953
Coby: Yes. Why is she wearing a diving mask and fins?

3
00:00:20.954 --> 00:00:22.178
Mark: I don't know.

4
00:00:22.179 --> 00:00:24.267
But she looks cool!

5
00:00:24.268 --> 00:00:26.810
Daisy: She doesn't look cool.

6
00:00:26.811 --> 00:00:28.568
She looks weird.

7
00:00:28.569 --> 00:00:30.095
Jenna: I don't believe it.

8
00:00:30.096 --> 00:00:32.562
You were right, Coby.

9
00:00:32.563 --> 00:00:36.582
Jenna: She does look like an alien!

10
00:00:36.583 --> 00:00:39.086
Miss Gray: Good morning, second graders.

11
00:00:39.087 --> 00:00:43.159
Miss Gray: Welcome back to South Street School.

12
00:00:43.160 --> 00:00:55.334
Miss Gray: Follow me, please!

13
00:00:55.335 --> 00:00:57.194
Mark: Where are we going?

14
00:00:57.195 --> 00:00:59.135
Coby: Swimming, I hope.

15
00:00:59.136 --> 00:01:05.672
Miss Gray: We're going diving! In Room Two . . .

16
00:01:05.673 --> 00:01:09.079
Miss Gray: We are going to dive into learning!

17
00:01:09.080 --> 00:01:11.381
Daisy: Dive into learning?

18
00:01:11.382 --> 00:01:13.471
What does that mean?

19
00:01:13.472 --> 00:01:15.762
Jenna: I don't know what it means.

20
00:01:15.763 --> 00:01:17.568
Jenna: But I hate to swim.

21
00:01:17.569 --> 00:01:20.541
I'm probably going to drown!

22
00:01:20.542 --> 00:01:31.709
Miss Gray: Please go inside and find your seat.

23
00:01:31.710 --> 00:01:34.458
Mark: I sit here. Look, Coby!

24
00:01:34.459 --> 00:01:36.245
You sit next to me!

25
00:01:36.246 --> 00:01:41.343
Coby: Wow. Second grade is going to be great!

26
00:01:41.344 --> 00:01:43.206
Jenna: I found my name.

27
00:01:43.207 --> 00:01:45.668
Where are you, Daisy?

28
00:01:45.669 --> 00:01:51.633
Daisy: Oh no . . . I sit way over there, next to Kara.

29
00:01:51.634 --> 00:01:53.531
Daisy: She's so mean.

30
00:01:53.532 --> 00:01:56.004
Daisy: I don't want to sit next to her!

31
00:01:56.005 --> 00:02:02.744
Jenna: And I have to sit next to two boys.

32
00:02:02.745 --> 00:02:04.842
Miss Gray: Girls, you don't look happy.

33
00:02:04.843 --> 00:02:06.319
Is there a problem?

34
00:02:06.320 --> 00:02:09.018
Jenna and Daisy: No, Miss Gray.

35
00:02:09.019 --> 00:02:11.362
Miss Gray: Good.

36
00:02:11.363 --> 00:02:14.692
Miss Gray: Okay, boys and girls, now we're going to . . .

37
00:02:14.693 --> 00:02:18.448
Jenna: Our teacher is Miss Gray.

38
00:02:18.449 --> 00:02:23.965
I'm having a rotten day!
